{"seq":1,"slug":"congestion-drivers-port-dwell-model","title":"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列/停留时长度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/congestion-drivers-port-dwell-model","wordCount":2907,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列-停留时长度量模型\">拥堵驱动因素与港口队列/停留时长度量模型</h1><p>同一个 40 尺箱在洛杉矶港要等 9 天才能提到，在鹿特丹只需 2 天——差别不在单箱操作效率，而在<strong>整条泊位-堆场-闸口链条已经排到多长</strong>。要预测滞箱滞港费风险，先得把「拥堵」拆成可以逐日观测、可以外推的量：到港船舶的到达强度、泊位服务速率、堆场箱位占用率、闸口吞吐能力，以及把前四者翻译成「这票货还要等几天」的停留时长分布模型。本文聚焦这套度量模型本身：哪些指标真驱动停留时长，如何用排队论把驱动因素连成可计算链条，以及 2026 年可用的公开数据源与工程落地方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念与度量框架\">核心概念与度量框架</h2><p>在工程语境下，「港口拥堵」不是一个形容词，而是一组<strong>可测的状态变量</strong>。度量模型至少需要区分三个层次的对象，缺一层就会得出误导性的结论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>到达强度（Arrival Intensity）</strong>——单位时间内到达的船舶数或 TEU 量，记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>。它反映需求侧压力，受旺季、航线重构、绕行改道影响。</li>\n<li><strong>服务能力（Service Capacity）</strong>——单位时间内港口能处理的船舶数或 moves 数，记 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。泊位、岸桥、工人班次、堆场机械共同决定它。</li>\n<li><strong>利用率（Utilization, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>——需求对能力的占用比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda/(c\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它是把前两者连到等待时间的枢纽变量，也是唯一直接决定「非线性拐点」的量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把三者与「停留时长」连起来的是<strong>排队模型</strong>本身：利用率越高，等待时间对需求波动的敏感度越大。度量模型要做的，就是把每个驱动因素映射到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 或某个容量约束上，再用模型推演出停留时长的<strong>分布</strong>而非平均值。此外还要分清两类时长：**集装箱停留时长（Container Dwell Time）**计量单个箱子在港或出闸后的占用时间，是滞箱滞港费的直接依据；**船舶在港时长（Port Stay）**计量船舶从到港到离港的时间，是拥堵的宏观信号。二者由不同队列决定，只在堆场瓶颈处耦合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拥堵的驱动因素与可观测代理指标\">拥堵的驱动因素与可观测代理指标</h2><p>港口拥堵从来不是单一原因，而是<strong>需求脉冲、泊位服务能力、堆场容纳能力、内陆疏运瓶颈、外部冲击</strong>五类因素的叠加。把它们分开观测，是为了避免把「船太多」和「箱子出不去」两类完全不同的问题混进同一个预测里——前者靠船舶调度解决，后者靠堆场与铁路疏运解决，混淆会让预警失去指向性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>驱动类别</th>\n<th>物理机制</th>\n<th>可观测代理指标（含数据源）</th>\n<th>对停留时长的作用方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>需求脉冲</strong></td>\n<td>旺季抢运、班轮联盟重构航线、红海绕行导致到港时间聚集</td>\n<td>周度到港船舶数 / TEU（MarineTraffic、VesselFinder AIS 聚合；Port Authority 周报）</td>\n<td>到达强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 上升 → 等待时间非线性上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>泊位服务能力</strong></td>\n<td>岸桥数量、泊位长度、工人班次（ILA 工会谈判中断）</td>\n<td>平均在泊时长（Berth Time）、岸桥小时作业量（moves/hour）</td>\n<td>服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 下降 → 队列长度上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>堆场容纳能力</strong></td>\n<td>堆存密度、空箱积压、危险品与冷藏箱分区占用</td>\n<td>堆场利用率（Yard Utilization %）、空箱占比</td>\n<td>堆场接近饱和 → 卸船后「箱位等待」延长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>内陆疏运瓶颈</strong></td>\n<td>卡车预约排队、铁路班列不足、底盘车（chassis）短缺</td>\n<td>闸口周转时长、铁路滞留（on-dock rail dwell）、底盘车可用率</td>\n<td>提箱受阻 → 重箱停留超免费期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>外部冲击</strong></td>\n<td>极端天气、航道事故、罢工、公共卫生事件</td>\n<td>港口关闭小时数、锚地等泊船数</td>\n<td>阶跃式抬高驻留，难以用历史均值预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2021 年洛杉矶/长滩港外一度积压 100 余艘等泊船、2024 年红海绕行把亚欧航线航程拉长约 10 天并打乱到港节奏，这两次事件的共同点是<strong>驱动因素从服务端转移到了需求端与外部冲击</strong>。工程含义是：预测模型必须给需求项与外部冲击项留出独立开关，不能只用一个平滑的历史均值当成「港口常速」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用排队论把驱动因素连成可计算的等待模型\">用排队论把驱动因素连成可计算的等待模型</h2><p>把「船到港-等泊-卸船-箱子进场-提走」看成串联的多级排队系统，就能把上表的驱动因素变成公式里的参数，从而对「多等一天要多付多少钱」给出可推演的答案。最简形式是 M/M/c 的 Erlang-C 模型：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个泊位/岸桥，到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>（船/天），单泊位服务率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>（船/天），则系统利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda / (c\\mu)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，等待时间会发散式上升——这正是拥堵的数学本质：<strong>接近饱和时，需求的小幅增加会带来等待时间的大幅增加</strong>。</p>\n<p>平均排队等待时间（Erlang-C）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>ρ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q = \\frac{C(c, \\rho)}{c\\mu - \\lambda}, \\quad C(c,\\rho) = \\frac{\\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-\\rho}}{\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1}\\frac{(c\\rho)^k}{k!} + \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-\\rho}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2846em;vertical-align:-1.4035em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8811em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0324em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0324em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.782em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5935em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2624em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0324em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9035em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0324em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4035em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>停留时长的全链条由三段相加：<strong>等泊（锚地/漂航）+ 在泊作业 + 卸船后堆场等待</strong>。后两端常被低估——2024 年后不少港口的瓶颈已从泊位转到堆场与铁路，卸船只要 1 天，箱子却要在堆场躺 6 天。把三段分别建模而非用单一平均值，才能定位「加钱也提不走」的真实卡点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;船舶到达&lt;br/&gt;Arrival rate λ&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;锚地等泊&lt;br/&gt;Berth queue&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;c 个泊位&lt;br/&gt;服务率 μ&quot;| C[&quot;在泊作业&lt;br/&gt;Berth time&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;卸船进场&lt;br/&gt;Discharge to yard&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E{&quot;堆场箱位&lt;br/&gt;Yard capacity&quot;}&#10;  E --&gt;|&quot;占用率 → 1&quot;| F[&quot;堆场等待&lt;br/&gt;Yard dwell&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;闸口提箱&lt;br/&gt;Gate-out&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;内陆疏运&lt;br/&gt;Truck / Rail&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;空箱返还&lt;br/&gt;Empty return&quot;]&#10;  E -. &quot;空箱积压回流&quot; .-&gt; F&#10;  H -. &quot;底盘车短缺&quot; .-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"船舶到达&lt;br/&gt;Arrival rate λ\"] --&gt; B{\"锚地等泊&lt;br/&gt;Berth queue\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"c 个泊位&lt;br/&gt;服务率 μ\"| C[\"在泊作业&lt;br/&gt;Berth time\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"卸船进场&lt;br/&gt;Discharge to yard\"]\n  D --&gt; E{\"堆场箱位&lt;br/&gt;Yard capacity\"}\n  E --&gt;|\"占用率 → 1\"| F[\"堆场等待&lt;br/&gt;Yard dwell\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"闸口提箱&lt;br/&gt;Gate-out\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"内陆疏运&lt;br/&gt;Truck / Rail\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"空箱返还&lt;br/&gt;Empty return\"]\n  E -. \"空箱积压回流\" .-&gt; F\n  H -. \"底盘车短缺\" .-&gt; G</pre><p>模型的核心输出不是一个点估计，而是<strong>分位数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Dwell</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{Dwell} &gt; \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dwell</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda, \\mu, \\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 下，停留时长超过免费期阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率。对滞箱费治理而言，这个分位数直接对应「预期滞港费敞口」——把当前船期与堆场占用率喂进去，就能算出未来 7 天哪些箱大概率要超免费期，从而提前安排提箱或申请延长免费期。</p>\n<p>模型必须做<strong>参数校准</strong>而不是套用教科书常数。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 不能取铭牌岸桥速度，要用近 30 天滚动实测（含等候、换班、天气中断）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 要用未来船期表（Berth Window / Proforma Schedule）而非历史平均。当堆场利用率超过约 85% 时，堆场等待段会表现出与泊位不同的非线性拐点，需要单独的分段模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公开数据源与-2026-年可用的拥堵指数\">公开数据源与 2026 年可用的拥堵指数</h2><p>度量模型要有燃料，2026 年可用的公开与半公开数据分几类，各自有明确的用途与盲区。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据类别</th>\n<th>代表来源</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>主要盲区</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>AIS 船舶轨迹</strong></td>\n<td>MarineTraffic、VesselFinder、Spire</td>\n<td>分钟级位置</td>\n<td>需自建「锚地停留→靠泊」事件识别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>港口务数据</strong></td>\n<td>各港务局（Port of LA/LB、Rotterdam、Singapore MPA）周报与 API</td>\n<td>日/周</td>\n<td>口径不统一，非强制公开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>班轮时刻与舱位</strong></td>\n<td>Sea-Intelligence、Alphaliner、各船司 Proforma Schedule</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>商业订阅，不覆盖全部船司</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>滞留时间统计</strong></td>\n<td>承运人/码头公开的 Dwell Time 报告、DCSA Track &amp; Trace</td>\n<td>箱级事件</td>\n<td>覆盖度依赖船司是否开放 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宏观拥堵指数</strong></td>\n<td>联合国贸发会议（UNCTAD）LSCI、世界银行-标普全球 CPPI</td>\n<td>季度/年度</td>\n<td>频率太低，只能做基准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>UNCTAD 的<strong>班轮运输连通性指数（LSCI）<strong>自 2004 年编制、按季度更新，衡量一国/一港与全球班轮网络的接入程度；2024 年后会周期性附带</strong>港口停靠延误</strong>监测，帮助判断延误是系统性还是局部性。世界银行与标普全球的 <strong>CPPI（Container Port Performance Index）<strong>使用船舶在港停留时间对全球港口排名，是跨港基准的权威参照。工程上应把</strong>低频权威指数</strong>（LSCI、CPPI）当作长期基线与枢纽选择依据，把<strong>高频 AIS + 码头事件流</strong>当作日度预警输入——用年度排名驱动日度调度会做出错误的船期决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从度量模型到运营预警-阈值-回测与治理闭环\">从度量模型到运营预警：阈值、回测与治理闭环</h2><p>度量模型的终点是<strong>可行动的预警</strong>，而不是一张更漂亮的仪表盘。落地路径通常包含三层：指标计算层、预测层、治理动作层。</p>\n<p>指标计算层把原始数据转成上表中的代理指标，关键是<strong>统一口径与可复算</strong>：堆场利用率必须写明是「按可用箱位」还是「按物理面积」，等泊时间必须写明是从锚泊到靠泊还是从到港报告到靠泊。口径不一致会让跨港比较和阈值设定失效。</p>\n<p>预测层用分位数回归或排队模型输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Dwell</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{Dwell} &gt; \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dwell</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，并以**回测（backtest）**验证：用过去 12 个月数据滚动预测「超期箱数」，与真实超期箱数比对，计算命中率与校准度。物流领域极易出现「模型看起来准、实际毫无预警价值」的情况，回测是唯一能证伪它的手段。</p>\n<p>治理动作层把预测翻译成成本与动作，形成闭环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;多源数据&lt;br/&gt;AIS + 码头事件 + 船期&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;代理指标计算&lt;br/&gt;λ / μ / ρ / 堆场利用率&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;排队/分位数模型&lt;br/&gt;P(Dwell &gt; τ)&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;超期概率阈值&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;高&quot;| E[&quot;提前提箱 / 申请延长免费期&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;高&quot;| F[&quot;改配内陆通道&lt;br/&gt;铁路替代卡车&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;低&quot;| G[&quot;维持常规调度&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; H[&quot;滞港费敞口预测&lt;br/&gt;成本入账&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;回测与阈值再校准&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"多源数据&lt;br/&gt;AIS + 码头事件 + 船期\"] --&gt; B[\"代理指标计算&lt;br/&gt;λ / μ / ρ / 堆场利用率\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"排队/分位数模型&lt;br/&gt;P(Dwell &gt; τ)\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"超期概率阈值\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"高\"| E[\"提前提箱 / 申请延长免费期\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"高\"| F[\"改配内陆通道&lt;br/&gt;铁路替代卡车\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"低\"| G[\"维持常规调度\"]\n  E --&gt; H[\"滞港费敞口预测&lt;br/&gt;成本入账\"]\n  F --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[\"回测与阈值再校准\"]\n  I --&gt; C</pre><p>闭环里最容易被忽略的一环是<strong>阈值的动态再校准</strong>。港口进入旺季或遭遇罢工时，历史阈值会系统性偏低，导致预警滞后。做法是把阈值设为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 或等泊时间的函数，当利用率跨过拐点时自动收紧，在拥堵爆发前把提箱动作前置——这正是把「拥堵度量」与「滞箱费治理」接起来的接口：<strong>越早预测到停留时长会超免费期，越能用低成本动作（提前提箱、改通道、申请延期）替代高成本的滞港费与申诉</strong>。</p>\n<p>需要提醒的边界是：预测模型只能降低敞口，不能消除承运人条款与码头操作的不确定性。当外部冲击发生阶跃时，任何基于历史分布的模型都会失效，此时应切换到<strong>情景推演</strong>而非统计外推，并按合同条款主张不可抗力或申请暂停计时。该口径处理属免费期时钟模型范畴，本文只给出「多大概率、多长停留、多大敞口」的量化输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拥堵由<strong>需求脉冲、泊位服务能力、堆场容纳能力、内陆疏运瓶颈、外部冲击</strong>叠加而成，每类都有可观测的代理指标与数据源。</li>\n<li>用<strong>串联排队模型</strong>（等泊 + 在泊 + 堆场等待）能把驱动因素连成可计算链条；利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时等待时间发散，是拥堵的数学本质。</li>\n<li>模型输出应是<strong>分位数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>Dwell</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{Dwell} &gt; \\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dwell</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，直接对应滞港费敞口，而非单点均值。</li>\n<li>数据分两层：低频权威指数（UNCTAD LSCI、世界银行 CPPI）做基准，高频 AIS 与码头事件流做日度预警，切忌混用时间尺度。</li>\n<li>落地要<strong>统一口径、滚动回测、动态再校准阈值</strong>，把预警接到「提前提箱 / 改内陆通道 / 申请延期」的治理动作。</li>\n<li>时间锚点与事件定义见<a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\">免费期时钟模型与集装箱全生命周期事件时间线</a>，事件流接入见<a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/container-event-ingestion-edi-terminal-api\">集装箱事件接入：EDI 与码头 API</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列/停留时长度量模型","id":"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列-停留时长度量模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念与度量框架","id":"核心概念与度量框架"},{"level":2,"text":"拥堵的驱动因素与可观测代理指标","id":"拥堵的驱动因素与可观测代理指标"},{"level":2,"text":"用排队论把驱动因素连成可计算的等待模型","id":"用排队论把驱动因素连成可计算的等待模型"},{"level":2,"text":"公开数据源与 2026 年可用的拥堵指数","id":"公开数据源与-2026-年可用的拥堵指数"},{"level":2,"text":"从度量模型到运营预警：阈值、回测与治理闭环","id":"从度量模型到运营预警-阈值-回测与治理闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"费用追回、核销与成本泄漏分析（追回率/预提/供应商对账）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/recovery-writeoff-cost-leakage"},"next":{"title":"滞箱成本预测、风险评分与提前预警机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/dd-cost-prediction-early-warning"}}